摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Command history for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web GUI composer — press ↑ / ↓ to cycle through your previously sent instructions, then restore the draft you were editing when you reach the end of the history.","id":"gh:1339025533","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-composer-history","slug":"baisama-cloud/dsh-composer-history","topics":["ai-history","deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","harness","plugin","plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Command history for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web GUI composer — press ↑ / ↓ to cycle through your "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"previously sent instructions, then restore the draft you were editing when you reach the end of the "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ly sent instructions, then restore the draft you were editing when you reach the end of the history."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-composer-history"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Command history for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web GUI composer — press **↑ / ↓** to cycle through y"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"our previously sent instructions, then restore the draft you were editing when you reach the end of "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ly sent instructions, then restore the draft you were editing when you reach the end of the history."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DSH Web 界面输入框的命令历史插件：**↑ / ↓** 上下方向键逐一浏览此前发送的指令，回到历史末尾时恢复你编辑前的草稿。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features / 功能"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **↑** switches to an older sent instruction, **↓** to a newer one — the current draft is preserved"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" underneath.\n- When you reach the newest entry and press **↓** again, the draft you were editing is "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"restored.\n- Only finished **user** messages count; system-injected reminders are skipped.\n- Multi-li"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ne drafts are safe: ↑ is taken over only on the first line, ↓ only on the last line.\n- Never trigger"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s during IME composition, with text selected, or with Ctrl / Cmd / Alt / Shift held.\n- Works in both"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" the official desktop app (Lexical `contenteditable` composer) and web-profile builds (`textarea` co"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"icial desktop app (Lexical `contenteditable` composer) and web-profile builds (`textarea` composer)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install / 安装"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"or in DSH settings → Plugins market, add the repository. 或在 DSH 设置 → 插件市场中添加本仓库安装。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Usage / 使用"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Click into the composer in any session.\n2. Press **↑** to step back through previously sent comma"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nds; press **↓** to move forward, and once past the newest entry your original draft returns.\n3. Edi"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"t a recalled command and send it as usual."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Development / 开发"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"This is a standard DSH bundle:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `lib/index.js` — host half (intentionally empty; all behavior is client-side)\n- `lib/client.js` — "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"browser half, a Cordis plugin registered via `window.__ModuleLoader__.load`; it hooks the `conversat"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ion.input.left` slot, locates the composer editor (a `textarea` in web-profile builds, the official "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"desktop app's `[data-composer-input]` contenteditable), reads the draft through `useInput`/`inputAct"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ions`, and collects user messages from `useChat` (desktop), `session.chat` (web profile), or the old"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"er flat `session.nodes` shape\n- `cordis.patch.yml` — loader row inserting the plugin"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Build the npm tarball with:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Requires `react` and `@deepseek-ai/cordis` as peer dependencies (provided by the DSH installation)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License / 许可证"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
